<title>USA: Esat Holdings Ltd issues $85 million 144a debt.</title>
<headline>Esat Holdings Ltd issues $85 million 144a debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Esat Holdings Ltd was priced in the 144a private placement market Monday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER ESAT HOLDINGS LTD</p>
<p>AMT $85.425 MLN (PRCDS)   COUPON 12.50 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/07</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DEFERRED COUPON  ISS PRICE 54.411   FIRST PAY 2/01/02</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Caa	    YIELD 12.50 YTM</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS	     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: Five-year zero coupon</p>
<p>	 Three year equity call for 1/3 issue at 112.50</p>
<p>	 Sold with warrants for three percent of company.</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
